{"id": "EUVD-2026-97590", "enisaUuid": "ddc03f97-51bb-324a-89c5-84fcf735ea4c", "description": "Open WebUI before 0.11.4 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability in MarkdownInlineTokens.svelte, which renders markdown link URLs into anchor hrefs without validating their scheme. Authenticated users can embed javascript: links in shared chats that, when clicked by a victim, steal the victim's JWT from local storage, including admins' tokens.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:04:50", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T15:39:33", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:A/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-wf9m-46cp-c6h6", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/open-webui-before-0.11.4-stored-xss-via-javascript-urls-in-markdown-links"], "aliases": ["GHSA-fhg2-q543-9wpq", "CVE-2026-109288"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0c11e1cb-a527-32fc-8268-afe6042e7187", "product": {"name": "open-webui", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.11.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "398f2074-ae38-3a4c-ab65-e6e5125947eb", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}], "isExploited": false}